00:17:24,140 --> 00:17:24,970
Oh!

262
00:17:27,480 --> 00:17:29,317
He's pulling him out of the ground!

263
00:17:29,400 --> 00:17:30,576
Get your back, Nami!

264
00:17:30,980 --> 00:17:31,810
No!

265
00:17:32,620 --> 00:17:33,450
Oh!

266
00:17:34,120 --> 00:17:34,950
Oh! Oh!

267
00:17:35,033 --> 00:17:35,863
Oh!

268
00:17:41,820 --> 00:17:44,280
He's not a giant, his head's just big!

269
00:17:52,300 --> 00:17:53,820
Have you gone mad?

270
00:17:54,120 --> 00:17:57,297
You think we wouldn't notice that
you're spilling info to the enemy?

271
00:17:57,380 --> 00:17:59,480
You insufferable fool! Wait!

272
00:17:59,840 --> 00:18:01,720
Let's not be rash now, Cracker!

273
00:18:01,940 --> 00:18:03,317
